KiyArch Live Environment

Available commands:

  kiyarch-help       Show this help screen
  kiyarch-hw         Detect hardware and installation recommendations
  kiyarch-install    Build a validated installation plan
  kiyarch-plan       Validate an exported installation plan
  kiyarch-execute    Execute a validated 1.1 plan (destructive; final y/N confirmation)
  kiyarch-menu       Open the local tty1 welcome menu
  kiyarch-network    Show live network status
  kiyarch-ssh        Show live SSH status and connection details

KiyArch terminal-first live environment

From the local tty1 menu, Install KiyArch selects the disk, shows the planned
layout, re-checks the target, and proceeds to one final erase confirmation.

